---
layout: layout.njk
title: 研究方向
permalink: /research/index.html
---
<section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH</p><h1><span aria-hidden="true">🔬</span> 研究方向</h1>{% for d in site.directions %}<section class="research-block" id="{{ d.id }}"><p class="eyebrow">{{ d.subtitle }}</p><h2>{{ d.title }}</h2><p class="lead">{{ d.description }}</p>{% for area in d.subareas %}<section class="modality-section" id="{{ d.id }}-{{ area.id }}"><h3 class="year"><span aria-hidden="true">{% if area.id == 'audio' %}🎙️{% else %}🎬{% endif %}</span> {{ area.title }}</h3><p>{{ area.description }}</p>{% set items = collections.published | direction(d.id) | modality(area.id) %}{% include 'cards.njk' %}</section>{% endfor %}{% if d.id == 'hiding' %}<section class="modality-section"><h3 class="year">相关图像研究</h3>{% set items = collections.published | direction(d.id) | modality('image') %}{% include 'cards.njk' %}</section><h3 class="year">早期研究脉络</h3><p class="source">以下依据团队已有工作汇报整理，详细书目信息后续补齐。</p><div class="cards">{% for work in site.historicalHiding %}<article class="card"><p class="meta">{{ work.venue }}</p><h3>{{ work.title }}</h3><p>{{ work.summary }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}</section>{% endfor %}</section>
